{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他在回看一段有过快乐也有过委屈的关系，开始不再逼自己选边，也不再为当初离开而自责，决定带着想念继续生活。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心软、想念、怕孤单、释然、坚定\",\n      \"missed\": \"第二段里“怕往后一个人熬”和“不愿只为有人陪着就回头”这两个重要的内心转折，需要逐句读才容易抓到。中间两行较小的音乐描述，尤其“一个人终于站出来、也像一群人一起抬头”，一眼容易略过。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经接受当初离开的选择，不再纠结该站在哪一边，虽然还惦记过去，但打算继续过自己的日子。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、心软、孤独感、逐渐释然、向前\",\n      \"missed\": \"“怕一个人熬”以及“不愿只为有人陪着就回头”藏在较长的白色文字里，不容易第一眼同时抓到。音乐描述与下方音符动画之间的联系也需要多看一眼才能建立。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起过去仍会心软，但已经不再责怪自己离开，也不打算因为害怕孤独而回头，而是带着想念继续往前。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"想念、心软、害怕孤独、释然、坚持\",\n      \"missed\": \"“不愿只为有人陪着就回头”需要读完整句才能抓到。底部新增的音乐变化描述字号较小、位置靠下，容易被忽略；它与人物继续往前的状态之间的呼应也不是第一眼就能发现。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"第二段大字一整句容纳了太多层意思：想起好时候、心软、怕孤独、不再自责、不愿回头、带着想念继续生活。绿色强调能让人迅速抓到“不再怪自己当初离开”和“带着想念继续过日子”，但最能体现人物真实处境的“怕孤独，却不愿为了有人陪伴而回头”藏在长句中，需要逐句读。人物的事和感受本身是连贯的，主要问题是这个关键的情感转折不够容易被一眼抓到；音乐动画与人物状态的联系则需要依靠字号较小的辅助描述来建立。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7c66c4f8-7e6a-4471-ad4b-4cc585ed3c5f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001648557995Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:18:12.894048+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "275cc1450e4cfd465d1b7e7953dff05a2430b58d35ae7174a2282ca0b2069dca", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001648557995Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "920baf135aaec9d163750d4b96fe8b853bfdccb1085792b6f9d3ac94787aa7d4"}}}
